Refill before each event, capped at capacity; accept and spend one token only when at least one is available.

```javascript
function solve(times, capacity, rate) {
  const results = [];
  let tokens = capacity;
  let previousTime = 0;

  for (const time of times) {
    tokens = Math.min(
      capacity,
      tokens + (time - previousTime) * rate
    );
    previousTime = time;

    const accepted = tokens >= 1;
    results.push(accepted);
    if (accepted) tokens -= 1;
  }

  return results;
}
```

